OL,3,GNEWSAPM visit sparks optimism for A1
OL,4,Adualling scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's comments
OL,7,Fon the A1 have sparked a wave of
OL,8,Foptimism that the case for dualling a
OL,9,Fstretch of the road could be
OL,10,Freconsidered.
OL,12,FSpeaking on a visit to Newcastle on
OL,13,FWednesday, Burnham told the Local
OL,14,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS) the
OL,15,Fgovernment would look to see if there
OL,16,Fwas an "alternative way" of putting
OL,17,Ftogether the necessary funding for the
OL,18,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
