OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPM visit sparks optimism for A1
OL,4,Adualling scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have been calling for the
OL,7,Fstretch between Morpeth and Berwick in
OL,8,FNorthumberland to be dualled for
OL,9,Fdecades.
OL,11,FPlans to dual 13 miles (21km) between
OL,12,FMorpeth and Ellingham were scrapped in
OL,13,F2024, but there has been renewed calls
OL,14,Ffollowing a string of accidents in
OL,15,Fwhich six people lost their lives.
